STATEMENT Burghard Fink, head of kitchen, 61:

My people take the tea to the blocks at 21:00 sharp. Who drove is in the SHIFT
PLAN. I myself was at goods reception until 20:30, then the office. Odd detail:
for months someone keeps donating books to the prison library, always shipped
via GREENFLASH CATERING. Donation slips carry different names but always the
same address.
